---
import AnumericList from "../../../custom/markdownElements/AnumericList.astro";
import NumericList from "../../../custom/markdownElements/NumericList.astro";
import CollapsibleNumericList from "../../../custom/markdownElements/CollapsibleNumericList.astro";
import HeaderText from "../../../custom/markdownElements/headerText.astro";
import Layout from "../../../pageContent_Wrappers/default.astro";

import Hero from "./hero.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <Hero />

  <div
    class="flex flex-col items-start justify-center w-full lg:w-[75%] h-fit gap-4"
  >
    <p
      class="text-LT_Primary dark:text-DT_Primary"
      data-i18n="doc.terms.paragraph"
    >
      By accessing YokaiVerse, you agree to be bound by these terms. Please read
      them carefully before creating an account.
    </p>

    <CollapsibleNumericList
      givenID="AccessAndRegistration"
      givenNumber="1"
      givenHeader="Access & Registration"
      data="doc.terms.AccessAndRegistration.header"
    >
      <p class="my-2" data-i18n="doc.terms.AccessAndRegistration.paragraph_1">
        While content metadata is public, accessing and viewing Anime, Manga, or
        Webtoon content requires a registered account. You are responsible for
        all activity occurring under your account and for maintaining the
        security of your credentials.
      </p>
    </CollapsibleNumericList>

    <CollapsibleNumericList
      givenID="ThirdPartyAIIntegrationAndTranslations"
      givenNumber="2"
      givenHeader="Third-Party AI Integration & Translations"
      data="doc.terms.ThirdPartyAIIntegrationAndTranslations.header"
    >
      <p
        class="my-2"
        data-i18n="doc.terms.ThirdPartyAIIntegrationAndTranslations.paragraph_1"
      >
        YokaiVerse utilizes a hybrid translation system consisting of
        human-verified translations and automated AI processing. Users may
        integrate their own
        <span class="font-semibold"> Third-Party AI API keys </span>
        to enable real-time translation features.
      </p>
      <p
        class="my-2"
        data-i18n="doc.terms.ThirdPartyAIIntegrationAndTranslations.paragraph_2"
      >
        The operational logic follows a strict hierarchy: human-verified
        translations are prioritized; if unavailable, the system utilizes the
        user's connected AI API; if no valid Third-Party API is provided,
        content remains in its original language. YokaiVerse is a platform
        provider and does not guarantee the accuracy of AI-generated content.
        All costs and usage limits associated with Third-Party APIs are the sole
        responsibility of the user.
      </p>
    </CollapsibleNumericList>

    <CollapsibleNumericList
      givenID="Advertisements"
      givenNumber="3"
      givenHeader="Advertisements"
      data="doc.terms.Advertisements.header"
    >
      <p class="my-2" data-i18n="doc.terms.Advertisements.paragraph_1">
        We use non-personalized, contextual advertisements. Ads are served based
        on the content genre or general site activity, rather than individual
        user profiles or behavioral tracking.
      </p>
    </CollapsibleNumericList>

    <CollapsibleNumericList
      givenID="ServiceModification"
      givenNumber="4"
      givenHeader="Service Modification"
      data="doc.terms.ServiceModification.header"
    >
      <p class="my-2" data-i18n="doc.terms.ServiceModification.paragraph_1">
        We reserve the right to add or remove support for specific Third-Party
        AI providers at any time without prior notice to the user.
      </p>
    </CollapsibleNumericList>

    <CollapsibleNumericList
      givenID="AmendmentsAndModifications"
      givenNumber="5"
      givenHeader="Amendments & Modifications"
      data="doc.terms.AmendmentsAndModifications.header"
    >
      <p
        class="my-2"
        data-i18n="doc.terms.AmendmentsAndModifications.paragraph_1"
      >
        YokaiVerse reserves the right to modify or replace these Terms at any
        time at our sole discretion. Users will be notified of significant
        changes via their registered email or through an on-site notification 7
        to 30 days in advance. By registering and continuing to use the service,
        you provide legal consent to these terms. If you do not agree to the
        updated terms, you must cease using the platform.
      </p>
    </CollapsibleNumericList>

    <CollapsibleNumericList
      givenID="UserIdentity"
      givenNumber="6"
      givenHeader="User Identity and @Username Policy"
      data="doc.terms.UserIdentity.header"
    >
      <p class="my-2" data-i18n="doc.terms.UserIdentity.paragraph_1">
        Upon registration, every user is assigned a unique @username. While
        users may set a "Display Name", the @username remains the permanent
        unique identifier. To protect user privacy and prevent identity theft,
        once an account is deleted, its @username is permanently retired and
        will <span class="font-semibold">never</span> be made available for registration
        again.
      </p>
      <p class="my-2" data-i18n="doc.terms.UserIdentity.paragraph_2">
        The only exception to this lock is a formal reclamation request by the
        original owner, which requires verification of exact account creation
        dates, historical display name logs, and last viewed content. This
        policy is strictly enforced to prevent impersonation within the
        community.
      </p>
    </CollapsibleNumericList>

    <CollapsibleNumericList
      givenID="AgeRestrictions"
      givenNumber="7"
      givenHeader="Age Restrictions & Verification"
      data="doc.terms.AgeRestrictions.header"
    >
      <p class="my-2" data-i18n="doc.terms.AgeRestrictions.paragraph_1">
        By registering, you certify that you are at least 16 years of age.
        YokaiVerse is a 16+ platform. Our verification is based on the birth
        year provided during registration; providing false information holds
        YokaiVerse zero liability for any content encountered.
      </p>
      <p class="my-2" data-i18n="doc.terms.AgeRestrictions.paragraph_2">
        Users under 18 can view and "like" age appropriate content but are
        strictly prohibited from participating in Forums or Comment sections.
        Access to adult-oriented content and community features is reserved
        strictly for users aged 18 and older. Any user under 18 found bypassing
        these restrictions will be banned immediately.
      </p>
    </CollapsibleNumericList>

    <CollapsibleNumericList
      givenID="ProhibitedConductAndEnforcement"
      givenNumber="8"
      givenHeader="Prohibited Conduct & Enforcement"
      data="doc.terms.ProhibitedConductAndEnforcement.header"
    >
      <p
        class="my-2"
        data-i18n="doc.terms.ProhibitedConductAndEnforcement.paragraph_1"
      >
        If a user is found violating age restrictions, engaging in harassment,
        or bypassing security, their IP address will be permanently blacklisted.
        Any new accounts created from a blacklisted IP will be terminated
        automatically. Users are solely responsible for their actions; in the
        event of illegal activities, YokaiVerse will cooperate fully with local
        law enforcement by providing all available logs and behavioral data
        without delay.
      </p>
      <NumericList
        givenID="DataIntegrityAndUserResponsibility_ALT"
        givenNumber="8.1"
        givenHeader="Data Integrity & User Responsibility"
        data="doc.terms.DataIntegrityAndUserResponsibility_ALT.header"
      >
        <p
          class="my-2"
          data-i18n="doc.terms.DataIntegrityAndUserResponsibility_ALT.paragraph_1"
        >
          YokaiVerse utilizes <span class="font-semibold">HttpOnly</span> technology
          for critical keys to prevent access by browser scripts. However, Tier 2
          preferences like themes and settings are stored in Local Storage and remain
          accessible via the console. Users are strictly warned against executing
          third-party code in the browser console (Self-XSS). YokaiVerse is not responsible
          for data theft or account breaches resulting from user-initiated script
          execution.
        </p>
      </NumericList>
    </CollapsibleNumericList>

    <CollapsibleNumericList
      givenID="MandatoryParentalControl"
      givenNumber="9"
      givenHeader="Mandatory Parental Control"
      data="doc.terms.MandatoryParentalControl.header"
    >
      <p
        class="my-2"
        data-i18n="doc.terms.MandatoryParentalControl.paragraph_1"
      >
        For users between 16 and 18, the account must be linked to a verified
        Parent/Guardian account. Parents have comprehensive oversight, including
        screen time management, content filtering by tags or genres, and full
        visibility into viewing history.
      </p>
      <p
        class="my-2"
        data-i18n="doc.terms.MandatoryParentalControl.paragraph_2"
      >
        The parent account holds administrative authority, meaning the minor
        cannot change birth years or sensitive settings without authorization.
        Parents can also remotely delete the minor's account at any time. Upon
        reaching age 18, these restrictions are automatically deactivated.
      </p>
      <NumericList
        givenID="ParentalConnectionMechanism_ALT"
        givenNumber="9.1"
        givenHeader="Parental Connection Mechanism"
        data="doc.terms.ParentalConnectionMechanism_ALT.header"
      >
        <p
          class="my-2"
          data-i18n="doc.terms.ParentalConnectionMechanism_ALT.paragraph_1"
        >
          The connection between accounts is established using secure,
          local-based authentication. This is done either via QR
          Synchronization, where the parent scans a code on the minor's device,
          or through a manual 10-character alphanumeric code. This ensures
          authorization happens through direct interaction, maintaining our
          commitment to zero-knowledge security protocols.
        </p>
      </NumericList>
    </CollapsibleNumericList>

    <CollapsibleNumericList
      givenID="GoverningLawAndDisputeResolution"
      givenNumber="10"
      givenHeader="Governing Law & Dispute Resolution"
      data="doc.terms.GoverningLawAndDisputeResolution.header"
    >
      <p
        class="my-2"
        data-i18n="doc.terms.GoverningLawAndDisputeResolution.paragraph_1"
      >
        These Terms and any disputes arising from them shall be governed by and
        construed in accordance with the laws of the Republic of Türkiye. The
        Personal Data Protection Law <span class="font-semibold">KVKK</span> remains
        the primary legal framework for all interactions. You agree that the courts
        and execution offices of Türkiye shall have exclusive jurisdiction.
      </p>
      <NumericList
        givenID="ConflictOfLaws"
        givenNumber="10.1"
        givenHeader="Conflict of Laws & Global Compliance"
        data="doc.terms.ConflictOfLaws.header"
      >
        <p class="my-2" data-i18n="doc.terms.ConflictOfLaws.paragraph_1">
          YokaiVerse is developed and hosted in Türkiye, and data processing is
          governed strictly by
          <span class="font-semibold"> Law No. 6698 KVKK </span>. While we
          respect global privacy principles, YokaiVerse will not comply with
          foreign regulations that contradict the mandatory provisions of
          Turkish Law. In the event of a legal conflict, the laws of the
          Republic of Türkiye shall prevail.
        </p>
      </NumericList>
    </CollapsibleNumericList>
  </div>
</Layout>
